shortdesc Write Metanorma standardization documents using LaTe
relocated 1
longdesc metanorma This work includes a LaTeX document class, a
longdesc `latexml` script and a `latexmlpost` stylesheet which allow you
longdesc to write a LaTeX document and transcode it into Metanorma's
longdesc `ADOC` format. This work is sponsored by Ribose Inc.
longdesc (<https://www.ribose.com>). This work is maintained by Ribose
longdesc Inc. (<open.source@ribose.com>).
